#
# The agent then signals whatever holds the tgid at reaction time, which after
# a pid wrap is not the workload that raised the record. This is the fail-open
# a join test bypasses if it stubs `ProcCgroupCheck` out: with a stub, every
# other assertion in this file still passes. The confirmation counter is left
# moving on purpose -- the mutation must be invisible to everything except the
# assertion that watches a real target leave a real cgroup.
